<title>SWITZERLAND: TABLE - UBS H1 net profit rises 67.4 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - UBS H1 net profit rises 67.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>				   (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     1,856	     vs 1,109</p>
<p> Operating income	     6,677	     vs 5,814</p>
<p> Trading income		 1,310	     vs 1,299</p>
<p> Operating expense	    3,829	     vs 3,189</p>
<p> Provisions for credit</p>
<p> and country risks	    137		 vs 776</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Union Bank of Switzerland (UBS).</p>
<p>Analysts had expected an increase in profit of between nearly 50 to 70 percent.</p>
</text>
